From: 78andyp <drandypowell@live.co.uk>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:23:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Video] Test refreshes that add the movie again.

The scanner tests could only refresh a movie whose refresh failed, as a
refresh and the scanner it adds the movie again with open the database
the settings name, which the test environment couldn't open. The tests
now name their own database in the settings, once the database manager
lets it be opened, and give the scanner the cache of disc contents that
reading a disc's playlists needs.

Covers a refresh keeping the hashes of the movie's folders, giving a
disc back the movie's other disc without its number in the title, and
keeping the extras a scan added after the movie was listed, and a
refresh of a source refreshing each disc of a movie from its own disc.

A refresh of a source no longer needs a GUI for its progress bar.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
